B.Pp=new A.aa("How is Bhagyagastro personalized?","Your Bhagyagastro book is created by analyzing the position of planets and stars at the time of your birth. This information allows us to generate a precise birth chart. Our expert astrologers then analyze this chart to provide deep insights into your personality, strengths, and life path.\n\nWe tailor compatibility reports based on your unique astrological profile, offering personalized advice to enhance your relationships. Additionally, we recommend crystals that resonate with your specific chart and provide Tarot card readings informed by your astrological data.\n\nFinally, you can choose the color and illustration for the custom cover, which features your name, making your Bhagyagastro book unique, personal, and one-of-a-kind.")
B.Px=new A.aa("What will I find inside my book?","Inside your personalized Bhagyagastro book, you will find:\n\n\u2022 A personalized birth chart analysis\n\u2022 Love & relationship insights tailored to you\n\u2022 Career & success guidance\n\u2022 Personality & life path profile\n\u2022 Personal astrological remedies\n\u2022 Compatibility reports\n\u2022 Crystal guide tailored to your astrological profile\n\u2022 Tarot card insights based on your unique astrological data\n\u2022 Astrological events calendar with key dates and transits")
B.PA=new A.aa("How long will it take to receive my book?","We start working on your book as soon as you order! Your eBook will reach your inbox within 24 hours, and it should take 8-16 business days for the paperback to arrive.")
B.Po=new A.aa("I'm new to astrology. Is this book right for me?",'Yes! When you start the process, we ask if you\'re new to astrology. If you say "Yes," we make sure the book is extra beginner-friendly. Bhagyagastro guides you step-by-step through your unique birth chart, explaining each element in clear, easy-to-understand language.')
B.PN=new A.aa("Will the book help me with my specific issues and goals?","That's exactly why we created Bhagyagastro. We understand that each person has a unique astrological profile, and generic guidance often falls short. Our book is designed to reflect what makes you special and align with your personal goals and challenges.")
